<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean buyers to seek cottonseed, rapeseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean buyers to seek cottonseed, rapeseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed-milling companies said on Thursday they will invite tenders for 16,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal, 8,000 tonnes of rapeseed meal by 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Friday.</p>
<p>Traders said sellers have to arrange a single-deck carrier freight. Arrival was set for the western port city of Inchon.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>Position	Tonne	Commods		Arrival</p>
<p>one	     8,000	cottonseed meal    Jan 20</p>
<p>two	     8,000	cottonseed meal    Feb 28</p>
<p>three	   8,000	rapeseed   meal    Feb 20</p>
</text>
